# CatDex — Map System

## Key files

- Screen: `app/(tabs)/map.tsx`
- Components: `src/components/maps/` — `CatMap` (+ `.native` / `.web`), `MapExplorerHud`, `MapCatModal`, pins, radius, player marker, map styles
- State/logic: `useMapExploreStore`, `src/lib/mapExplore.ts`, `worldCats.ts`

## Behaviors

- Custom HUD replaces tab bar for primary actions (Missions · Capture · CatDex)
- Capture FAB → `useCaptureGate` → `/scanner`
- Location CTA via in-map modal / banner — not a pre-map permission gauntlet
- Uncaptured cats: mystery presentation in `MapCatModal`

## Platform

- Native: `react-native-maps`
- Web: MapLibre path — verify both when changing camera/style/pins

## Rules

- Keep map palette helpers (`mapPalette`, pale isometric style) consistent with light CatDex look
- Don’t block map render on optional spawns
- Pin interactions should be thumb-friendly; modal owns detail CTAs
